OL,3,GNEWSARegulator rejects council's
OL,4,Ahomeless flats plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicester City Council's plan to use a
OL,7,Fblock of flats as temporary
OL,8,Faccommodation for homeless people has
OL,9,Fbeen rejected by the government's
OL,10,Fsafety regulator.
OL,12,FThe authority bought the Yoho building,
OL,13,Fin York Street, for #10.9m in February
OL,14,F2025 to provide 134 units of temporary
OL,15,Faccommodation.
OL,17,FHowever, the Building Safety Regulator
OL,18,F(BSR) confirmed it has refused to grant
OL,19,Fthe seven-storey building a safety
OL,20,Fcertificate for the proposed use.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
