OL,3,GNEWSARegulator rejects council's
OL,4,Ahomeless flats plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour-run council, which is paying
OL,7,Fbetween #10,000 and #12,000 a month for
OL,8,Fon-site security at the empty building,
OL,9,Fsaid a new application would be
OL,10,Fsubmitted and that the delays were
OL,11,F"deeply frustrating".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
